Hii ni ripoti ya {{business_name}}, kwa {{window_label}}.

Mapato yalikuwa {{total_revenue}}{{#if invoices_paid}} (pamoja na {{invoices_paid}} zilizolipwa kwa ankara){{/if}} na matumizi {{total_expenses}}{{#if stock_bought}}, pamoja na {{stock_bought}} zilizotumika kununua stoki{{/if}}, faida halisi ni {{net_cash_basis}}.
{{#if other_currencies}}Pia zimerekodiwa kwa sarafu nyingine (zimewekwa kando, hazijabadilishwa): {{#each other_currencies}}mapato {{revenue}}, matumizi {{expenses}}, stoki {{stock_bought}}, halisi {{net_cash_basis}}{{#unless @last}}; {{/unless}}{{/each}}.
{{/if}}
{{#if gross_margin}}Kwa gharama za stoki ulizorekodi, faida ghafi inakadiriwa kuwa {{gross_margin}}.
{{/if}}
{{#if top_sellers_by_quantity}}Vinavyouzwa zaidi: {{#each top_sellers_by_quantity}}{{item_name}} ({{quantity}} vimeuzwa){{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}.
{{/if}}
{{#if bottom_sellers_by_quantity}}Vinavyouzwa polepole: {{#each bottom_sellers_by_quantity}}{{item_name}} ({{quantity}} vimeuzwa){{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}.
{{/if}}
{{#if low_stock}}Stoki inakaribia kuisha: {{#each low_stock}}{{item_name}} ({{current_quantity}} zimebaki, agiza ikifika {{reorder_threshold}}){{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}. Fikiria kuongeza stoki hivi karibuni.
{{/if}}
{{#if declining_no_threshold}}Bidhaa hizi zinashuka na hazina kiwango cha kuagiza bado: {{#each declining_no_threshold}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}.
{{/if}}
{{#if recurring_revenue}}Mapato ya kila mwezi yanayotarajiwa: {{#each recurring_revenue}}{{label}} kwa {{monthly_amount}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}.
{{/if}}
{{#if recurring_expenses}}Gharama za kila mwezi zinazotarajiwa: {{#each recurring_expenses}}{{label}} kwa {{monthly_amount}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}.
{{/if}}
